            <description sparkle:format="markdown">Launch muet at login

- Choose Launch muet at login in Settings → General or during setup.
- Login launches stay quietly in the menu bar; opening muet normally shows its window.
- The setting follows macOS Login Items and explains when approval is needed.
</description>
